      "title": "Streichfett Reference Manual",
      "notes": "Controller chart (pages 21) read by tools/profiles/waldorf/read-waldorf-cc.mjs from Streichfett_Manual_EN.pdf (sha256 0d7291d42c7203ad1e35e4b04266394506f2c328e7d206d7d2b8e0ca909b2bec), https://downloads.waldorfmusic.com/cloud/index.php/s/BppCqf8X5knMwyC/download. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
