  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/waldorf/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/waldorf/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's controller chart, with its printed name, sent as a control change on the channel variable. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "Cells the reader could not read as printed, given by the layout: CC 70 String Registration.",
    "Left out, performance and channel mode controllers, which change no setting of the sound: CC 1 Modulation Wheel, CC 64 Sustain Pedal, CC 120 All Sound Off, CC 121 Reset All Controllers, CC 122 Local Control, CC 123 All Notes Off."
  ],
